WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
MCP-Bastion 5.1.0. Cost-aware runtime governance for AI agents.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Pre-deploy posture grades and local scan findings before tools go live.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Issue guides map each finding to remediation and Bastion knobs.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
OWASP ASI, MCP, and LLM coverage heatmaps with block pressure.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Live attack matrix shows which threat classes are under pressure now.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Evidence and reports for operators. Bastion emits traces, not legal advice.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
RBAC, prompt guard, rate and cost caps, PII, and Agent IAM.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Forensics explain why a call was blocked, with pillar provenance.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Agent IAM stops confused-deputy tool access outside policy.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Posture drift from audit JSONL: allow versus block over time.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
FinOps: token reduction and cost avoided by policy blocks.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Traffic and deny reasons across the governed MCP path.
